repository-code: "https://github.com/ETEllis/BiDi"
abstract: >-
  BiDi is an executable Universal Operator System integrating the
  Coherence-Delta Calculus formal language and native kernel, guarded U1
  lifted-cover acceptance, recurrence-gated U2 variational analysis,
  deterministic receipts, finite Lean/Rocq mirrors, and operator instruments.
  Version 0.3.0 differentiates the executed native path and emits monodromy or
  characteristic multipliers only after full or explicitly restored recurrence
  passes. The descriptor is repository-scoped: richer continuous, empirical,
  physical, and quantum interpretations remain open obligations.
